    process:{ stage:2, check:`FIND. Why rehearse before drafting? (Because a no I hear today saves me a week of writing the wrong thing.)` },
    bridge:`Editing for active voice this morning — "the field was closed" hides who closed it. In an argument, name the actor when it helps you and use passive when naming would sound like blame.`,
