    weDo:{ mins:5, title:`We Do — Model on One Plan`,
      instruction:`One plan on the visualiser. We run the three questions and give real answers.`,
      sentences:[`"I'd say yes — but only because of reason three."`,`"Reason two is the weakest; there's no evidence."`,`"The ask is too big — they'd need a board meeting."`],
      prompt:`Which comment would help this writer most on Monday?` },
    youDo:{ mins:12, title:`You Do — Gallery Walk`,
      instruction:`Plans on desks, sticky note beside each. Visit three only.`,
      tasks:[`On each note: would you say yes, which reason is weakest, is the ask doable?`,`Back at your desk: read your notes and mark the reason you'll strengthen first.`,`Get your plan, case file and audience card ready — Monday you draft.`] },
    close:`"Three weeks of preparation. On Monday it turns into writing, and it's going to be fast."`
