    youDo:{ mins:15, title:`You Do — Sustained Drafting`,
      instruction:`Longest write of the term so far. I'll take a small group on the EXPLAIN sentence at the back table.`,
      tasks:[`Draft reasons two and three as full PEEL paragraphs.`,`Each one: point, evidence with attribution, so-what explanation, link.`,`Save your strongest reason for last.`,`Note your word count in the margin.`] },
